  "questions": [
    {
      "question_no": "17",
      "standard_answer": "(1) ∠A=π/3；(2) ∠ABN=2π/3；(b²+c²−bc)/(b²+c²+bc)=3/7；b/c=2",
      "solution_steps": [
        "(1) 条件式两边同乘 sinA·sinB·sinC 得 sinB·sinC+sin²A=sin²B+sin²C；由正弦定理得 bc+a²=b²+c²；故 cosA=(b²+c²−a²)/(2bc)=1/2，∠A=π/3",
        "(2) 延长AM到N使AM=MN，得平行四边形ABNC，∠ABN=2π/3；推出 (2|BM|)²=b²+c²−bc 与 (2|AM|)²=b²+c²+bc；比值 (b²+c²−bc)/(b²+c²+bc)=3/7；化简得 2b²−5bc+2c²=0，结合 b>c 得 b/c=2"
      ],
      "grading_method": "process",
      "student_answer": "17.\n解：(1) 已知 \\frac{1}{sinA} + \\frac{sinA}{sinBsinC} = \\frac{sinB}{sinAsinC} + \\frac{sinC}{sinAsinB}\nsinBsinC + sin^2A = sin^2B + sin^2C\nbc + a^2 = b^2 + c^2\n\\cos A = \\frac{b^2+c^2-a^2}{2bc} = \\frac{1}{2}\n∵ ∠A ∈ (0, π)\n∴ ∠A = \\frac{π}{3}\n(2) 延长AM到点N使AM=MN\n四边形ABNC是平行四边形，∠ABN=\\frac{2π}{3}\n(2|BM|)^2 = b^2+c^2-bc\n(2|AM|)^2 = b^2+c^2+bc\n得：\\frac{b^2+c^2-bc}{b^2+c^2+bc} = \\frac{3}{7}\n2b^2-5bc+2c^2=0\n∵ b>c\n\\frac{b}{c} = 2"
    },
    {
      "question_no": "18",
      "standard_answer": "(1) 证明：A'D⊥平面A'BC；(2) cosθ=7√13/26",
      "solution_steps": [
        "(1) A'E⊥平面BCD，BC⊂平面BCD ⇒ A'E⊥BC；又 CD⊥BC，A'E∩CD=E ⇒ BC⊥平面A'CD ⇒ BC⊥A'D；又 A'D⊥A'B，A'B∩BC=B ⇒ A'D⊥平面A'BC",
        "(2) 以D为原点、DA为x轴、DC为y轴建系；AB=2, AD=1；C(0,2,0), B(1,2,0), A'(0,1/2,√3/2), M(0,1/4,√3/4)；平面MBC法向量 m=(0,√3,7)，|m|=√52；平面DBC法向量 n=(0,0,1)；cosθ=|m·n|/(|m||n|)=7√13/26"
      ],
      "grading_method": "process",
      "student_answer": "18.\n解：(1) 由题：A'E⊥平面BCD\n∵ BC ⊂ 平面BCD\n∴ A'E⊥BC\n又∵ CDBC, A'E∩CD=E\n∴ BC平面A'CD\n∵ A'D ⊂ 平面A'CD\n∴ BCA'D\n∵ A'D⊥A'B ; A'B∩BC=B\n∴ A'D平面A'BC\n(2) 以D为原点，DA为x轴，DC为y轴建立空间直角坐标系\n令AB=2 AD=1\n∴ C(0,2,0) B(1,2,0) A'(0,\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) M(0,\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4})\n\\vec{BC}=(-1,0,0) \\vec{CM}=(0,-\\frac{7}{4},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4})\n设平面MBC的一个法向量为 \\vec{m}=(x,y,z)\n解得：\\vec{m}=(0,\\sqrt{3},7)\n平面DBC的一个法向量为 \\vec{n}=(0,0,1)\n|\\vec{m}|=\\sqrt{52} |\\vec{n}|=1\n令\\vec{m}与\\vec{n}所成夹角为θ\n\\vec{m}·\\vec{n} = |\\vec{m}|·|\\vec{n}|\\cosθ\n\\cosθ = \\frac{7\\sqrt{13}}{26}\n∵ 该二面角为锐角\n∴ 二面角M-BC-D的余弦值为 \\frac{7\\sqrt{13}}{26}"
    },
    {
      "question_no": "19",
      "standard_answer": "(1) P=20/30=2/3；ξ~B(6,2/3)；P(ξ=k)=C(6,k)(2/3)^k(1/3)^(6−k)；(2) E(ξ)=4；f(x)=−½x²+120x；x=120 时最大利润 7200",
      "solution_steps": [
        "(1) 适合天气概率 P=20/30=2/3；ξ~B(6,2/3)；分布列 P(ξ=0..6)=1/729, 12/729, 60/729, 160/729, 240/729, 192/729, 64/729",
        "(2) ① E(ξ)=4；y=40xξ+(40−x/4)(6−ξ)x−120x=x²ξ/4−3x²/2+120x；② E(y)=−½x²+120x=−½(x−120)²+7200；答：x=120 时最大值为 7200"
      ],
      "grading_method": "process",
      "student_answer": "19.\n解：(1) 由题：“适合天气”的概率 P=\\frac{20}{30}=\\frac{2}{3}\n∴ ξ ~ B(6, \\frac{2}{3}) ξ的值可取0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6\nP(ξ=0) = (\\frac{1}{3})^6 = \\frac{1}{729}\nP(ξ=1) = C_6^1(\\frac{2}{3})(\\frac{1}{3})^5 = \\frac{12}{729} = \\frac{4}{243}\nP(ξ=2) = C_6^2(\\frac{2}{3})^2(\\frac{1}{3})^4 = \\frac{60}{729} = \\frac{20}{243}\nP(ξ=3) = C_6^3(\\frac{2}{3})^3(\\frac{1}{3})^3 = \\frac{160}{729}\nP(ξ=4) = C_6^4(\\frac{2}{3})^4(\\frac{1}{3})^2 = \\frac{240}{729} = \\frac{80}{243}\nP(ξ=5) = C_6^5(\\frac{2}{3})^5(\\frac{1}{3}) = \\frac{192}{729} = \\frac{64}{243}\nP(ξ=6) = C_6^6(\\frac{2}{3})^6(\\frac{1}{3})^0 = \\frac{64}{729}\n[表格]\nξ | 0 | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6\nP | \\frac{1}{729} | \\frac{4}{243} | \\frac{20}{243} | \\frac{160}{729} | \\frac{80}{243} | \\frac{64}{243} | \\frac{64}{729}\n\n(2) ① 由(1)得：E(ξ) = 6×\\frac{2}{3} = 4\n这6天内“适合天气”ξ天的销售金额为40x元，\n其余“不适合天气”(6-ξ)天的销售金额为\n(40-\\frac{x}{4})(6-ξ)x元 6天进购该蔬菜总金额为120x元\n∴ y = 40xξ + (40-\\frac{x}{4})(6-ξ)x - 120x\n= \\frac{x^2}{4}ξ - \\frac{3x^2}{2} + 120x\n② E(y) = \\frac{x^2}{4}E(ξ) - \\frac{3}{2}(x^2) + 120x\n= x^2 - \\frac{3}{2}x^2 + 120x = -\\frac{1}{2}x^2 + 120x\n令 f(x) = -\\frac{1}{2}x^2 + 120x = -\\frac{1}{2}(x-120)^2 + 7200\n答：当x=120时 E(y)有最大值为7200"
    },
